    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβάθμιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stepping over the
				threshold</i>: metaph., <i>going beyond bounds, transgressing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤρξαντο ὑ. τείνειν πόδα ὡς ἠδύνατο
				ἕκαστος,</span> of satraps, Anon.Hist.(<i><span class="en">
				<u>FGrH</u>
				155
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				p.836J.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πόδα ἀποτείνειν,</span>
			prov. of meddling with theology, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				98.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. π. τείνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marin.
					<u>Procl.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				2.29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβάθμιος; ὑ. π.
				πέμπειν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				6.13
			</span></i>.</div>
